WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.349
- And the rabbi got so pissed

00:00:02.349 --> 00:00:04.067
that I spoke Swahili from the bimah,

00:00:04.067 --> 00:00:05.460
