00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:08.195
(Jewish music)

00:00:17.076 --> 00:00:20.975
- Our bar mitzvah is basically
like a wedding, except not.

00:00:20.975 --> 00:00:23.604
- Right of passage into Jewish adulthood.

00:00:23.604 --> 00:00:24.984
And by Jewish adulthood,

00:00:24.984 --> 00:00:27.598
