00:00:27.598 --> 00:00:29.130
as you can possibly absorb

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:30.965
in like a three to four hour period.

00:00:30.965 --> 00:00:32.985
- A bar mitzvah's like
the best party ever,

00:00:32.985 --> 00:00:34.494
but it's wasted on 13 year olds.

00:00:34.494 --> 00:00:35.353
- You read from the Torah.

00:00:35.353 --> 00:00:36.096
You give a speech.

00:00:36.096 --> 00:00:37.373
Then there's a big party.

00:00:39.383 --> 00:00:40.551
- So that's me.

00:00:40.551 --> 00:00:41.248
- Stop it.

00:00:41.248 --> 00:00:42.177
- That's my sister--

00:00:42.177 --> 00:00:42.580
- Oh--

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:44.151
- And that tall man is Rabbi Gol.

00:00:44.151 --> 00:00:45.335
That's the party.

00:00:45.335 --> 00:00:46.310
- Holy (bleep).

00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:48.268
Everything's gold.

00:00:48.268 --> 00:00:49.979
Here, like you're still
smiling through the pain.

00:00:49.979 --> 00:00:51.539
- So there's me on the chair.

00:00:51.539 --> 00:00:53.183
- See, I never got lifted on the chair.

00:00:53.183 --> 00:00:55.280
They lifted my parents on the chair,

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:56.605
they lifted my two younger
brothers on the chair.

00:00:56.605 --> 00:00:57.711
- Wait, wait, at your bar mitzvah?

00:00:57.711 --> 00:00:58.942
- At my bar mitzvah,

00:00:58.942 --> 00:01:00.872
but they did not raise me.

00:01:00.872 --> 00:01:03.051
- You just look like a classic Jewish kid.

00:01:03.051 --> 00:01:04.768
- Except two feet smaller,

00:01:04.768 --> 00:01:05.860
and very confused.

00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:07.090
- My grandmother had passed away,

00:01:07.090 --> 00:01:08.762
like a few months before my bat mitzvah,

00:01:08.762 --> 00:01:09.970
and my best friend's grandmother

00:01:09.970 --> 00:01:11.409
who I'd known my whole life,

00:01:11.409 --> 00:01:12.361
she was there, and she was like,

00:01:12.361 --> 00:01:13.847
I'm here in her honor.

00:01:13.847 --> 00:01:16.118
I'm your surrogate bubbie.

00:01:16.118 --> 00:01:18.222
She was 75 at the time.

00:01:18.222 --> 00:01:20.484
She made out with my
DJ on the dance floor.

00:01:20.484 --> 00:01:22.664
(laughs)

00:01:22.664 --> 00:01:24.289
- You look like Ron Weasley.

00:01:24.289 --> 00:01:25.659
